# save: 24-Museum
# PSI Teleport alpha from the pause menu: the run, the vanish, the arrival in Twoson
# INIT_TELEPORT_ARRIVAL calls FADE_OUT inside a lag frame whose NMI already fired, so the first
# RUN_FRAMES_UNTIL_FADE_DONE wait returns without a fade step and the original runs one more
# frame of the run before the screen is dark (CPU time; the fade steps on NMIs)
# lag: 483
# the original lags during the fade-in (frames 586 merged), and each lag frame's NMI takes a fade
# step without a logic frame, so its fade-in ends a logic frame earlier (wall-clock noise)
# ignore: idle 587
flag 11 1; teleport 4000 9300 6; wait 10; until idle 300
---
press A; wait 30; press DOWN; press A; wait 60; press A; wait 60; press DOWN 2; wait 30; press A; wait 60
press DOWN; press A; wait 1500
